              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwakungekho mkhandi ezweni lonke lakwa-Israyeli, ngokuba amaFilisti athi: “AmaHeberu angazizenzele izinkemba nemikhonto.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
